            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Ouro Preto, MG · 2022, July, w/ uni friends · walked hills, churches, gold mine, pão de queijo! · why: history + friends + cold nights, fireplace",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
