        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fala modelo (≈1 min 50 s)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I'd like to talk about Ouro Preto, a historic town in Minas Gerais, in the south-east of Brazil. I went there in July 2022 with three friends from university, right after our exams.",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "As for what we did, we spent most of the time walking up and down the steep cobbled streets, which was exhausting but beautiful. We visited several baroque churches — some of them are covered in gold inside — and we also went down into an old gold mine, which was a bit scary because it was dark and narrow. In the evenings, we ate a lot of local food, especially pão de queijo and feijão tropeiro.",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The main reason I enjoyed it so much was the combination of history and good company. I'd studied the colonial period at school, but seeing the buildings in person made it feel real. Also, it was really cold at night, so we sat around a fireplace in our guesthouse, talking for hours. Looking back, it was one of the best trips I've ever had, and I'd love to go back one day.",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
